    "detailed_description": "Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of a gloomy medieval dark fantasy and try to find all the gnomes.<br>Meet various characters on your way and try to figure out what happened to this damned world that you yourself (in fact, we) created.<br><br><strong>Game Features</strong><br>- Stylish low-poly graphics that won't overload your computer<br>- The opportunity to explore the forest well in search of gnomes and feel like a real knight<br>- A specific goal of the game that you choose yourself<br>- Procedurally generated world and high replayability<br>- Five levels, five gnomes, nine story characters<br>- Six endings depending on your decision<br>- Unexpected plot twists<br>- A REAL opportunity to FINALLY find the gnomes<br>- A feeling of personal involvement in an iconic world event<br>- Low price matches the level of content's quality",
